Third-party files in this folder

These test fixtures are not covered by the MIT license of @computis/effect-xml.
They are not part of the published npm package, which ships only src and dist.
Every invoice in them is a sample with fictitious parties: none is a real invoice.

FatturaPA, by Agenzia delle Entrate (Italian Revenue Agency)
Source: https://www.fatturapa.gov.it/it/norme-e-regole/documentazione-fattura-elettronica/formato-fatturapa/
Retrieved and compared with the published files on 2026-10-07.

- xsd/Schema_VFPR12_v1.2.3.xsd
  From https://www.fatturapa.gov.it/export/documenti/fatturapa/v1.4/Schema_VFPR12_v1.2.3.xsd
  Changed: the xs:import of the XML Signature namespace points to the local
  xmldsig-core-schema.xsd instead of
  http://www.w3.org/TR/2002/REC-xmldsig-core-20020212/xmldsig-core-schema.xsd,
  so that validation never reads the network.

- fatturapa/IT01234567890_FPA01.xml, FPA02, FPA03, FPR01, FPR02, FPR03
  From https://www.fatturapa.gov.it/export/documenti/fatturapa/v1.2/
  The sample invoices published with the format. Unchanged except for line
  endings and the byte order mark.

XML Signature Syntax and Processing, by W3C

- xsd/xmldsig-core-schema.xsd
  From http://www.w3.org/TR/2002/REC-xmldsig-core-20020212/xmldsig-core-schema.xsd
