Files written for these tests

fattura-1-linea.xml, fattura-20-linee.xml and their .expected.xml variants,
fattura.ts, jit-documento.ts, messages.ts and the xsd-codegen folder were written
for this package, with fictitious parties ("Fornitore Esempio S.r.l.",
"Cliente Esempio S.p.A."), and are covered by its MIT license.
fattura-xsd.gen.ts is generated from the FatturaPA schema above.
